Greetings, Warriors!

Exciting news awaits you today! We're thrilled to unveil the second free DLC for Achilles: Legends Untold, featuring exclusive STL files that enable you to 3D-print yet another stunning rendition of our courageous hero.

Check out the important details:

 The download size is 491 MB and 1.1 GB after zip extraction;
 The files are configured for the resin 3D print only;
 There's an additional file with a helmetless head variant;
 The default height is around 20 cm;


[previewyoutube=G5H8v1WNK_4;full][/previewyoutube]

To get the files:

 In the Steam Store, enter the phrase "Achilles: Legends Untold" into the search bar;
 From the list of search results, select the free DLC with the printable figurine;
 Click the "Download" button;
 You'll find the files in the "Extras/3D Print Achilles Model" folder inside the game's main directory (Right-click on the game in your library > "Manage" > "Browse Local Files").


Refer to the visual guide below for assembling all the components:

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40963701/fe2e3ac9e643f64a7b611745baddf5362032a7d7.png

Download the files, bring them to life with your 3D printer, add your personal artistic touch, and showcase your masterpiece. Join in the excitement, share your creations, and let the world know about Achilles: Legends Untold!

